{"id": "70698", "title": "毒妻不好当", "author": "雾矢翊", "category": "都市言情", "count": 48, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/70/70698.htm", "intro": "阿宝觉得自己作为将军之女，自然是文墨有限，通习武艺，但被当成悍女，那可真是冤枉了。明明她也十分贤良淑德，女子应该会的女红厨艺管家中馈诸事她也会啊。\n    莫名多了个悍女名声，已经准备好这辈子不会有门好亲事时，一道圣旨将她赐婚于晋王为妃。\n    据闻晋王奸邪成性、酷戾狠毒，年纪一大把，却未成亲，只因无人愿意将女儿许予如此狠毒之人糟蹋。\n    阴险狠毒的晋王娶了镇北将军之女，京中诸人感概：这毒男配悍女，倒也相得！", "base": "files/article/html/70/70698", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第2章", "file": "11086802.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章", "file": "11086803.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8章", "file": "11086804.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11章", "file": "11086805.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14章", "file": "11086806.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17章", "file": "11086807.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20章", "file": "11086808.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23章", "file": "11086809.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第26章", "file": "11086810.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第29章", "file": "11086811.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第32章", "file": "11086812.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第35章", "file": "11086813.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第38章", "file": "11086814.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第41章", "file": "11086815.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第44章", "file": "11086816.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第47章", "file": "11086817.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第50章", "file": "11086818.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第53章", "file": "11086819.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第56章", "file": "11086820.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第59章", "file": "11086821.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第62章", "file": "11086822.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第65章", "file": "11086823.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第68章", "file": "11086824.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第71章", "file": "11086825.html", "av